# File Organization Structure

This project is a monorepo with two main top-level packages:
- `web/`: Frontend SPA (React, Vite, Tailwind, TypeScript, shadcn/ui for UI components)
- `api/`: Backend API (Node.js, TypeScript, NestJS)

```
web/
├── public/
│   ├── bike-example/
│   └── bpmn-xml-examples/
├── src/
│   ├── assets/
│   ├── components/
│   │   └── bpmn/
│   │   // shadcn components will be generated in 'components/ui' as needed
│   ├── lib/
│   ├── routes/
│   │   └── bpmn/
│   ├── types/
│   └── ...
├── package.json
└── ...

api/
├── src/
│   ├── app.module.ts
│   ├── main.ts
│   ├── bpmn/
│   ├── user-task-instances/
│   ├── process-instances/
│   ├── process-definitions/
│   ├── actors/
│   ├── actor-groups/
│   ├── tenants/
│   ├── entities/
│   └── ...
├── package.json
└── ...
```

# Import/Export Guidelines
- Use ESM imports/exports exclusively
- Use named exports for components and utilities
- Use default exports sparingly (mainly for main components)
- Group imports: React → third-party → internal → types → styles
